  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC/Solutions Alliance - Side-event under HCPF 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Refugee Council and the Somalia team in Solutions Alliance shared hosting the event. The Danish Minister for Trade and Development gave the opening speech, after which a panel of representatives from the Somali Interior Ministry, the World Bank, UNHCR, UNDP and the Regional Durable Solutions Secretariat (REDS) each gave a presentation, opened the discussion with fashion participants will composed of representatives of the host countries, development actors, civil society organizations, research institutes and UN organizations. Discussions are based on a report initiated by the Danish Refugee Council and conducted by the consulting company Samuel Hall under the guidance of the Regional Durable Solutions Secretariat (ReDSS), a consortium of NGOs.</narrative>
  </description>
